  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，先數「位數」再比大小的檢查策略。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, a check strategy of first counting the \"number of digits\" and then comparing the size.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，同分母比大小口訣：分母相同，分子越大分數越大。": "[Special Strategy]: Special Learning 1-Ⅱ-13, formula for ratios with the same denominators: the denominators are the same, the larger the numerator, the larger the fraction.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，向下取整百數估算。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, round down to the nearest hundred for estimation.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，百位有零 vs 百位有數之比大小迷思澄清。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, the myth about the ratio of zeros in hundreds vs numbers in hundreds is clarified.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，估算積的合理範圍檢核。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, check the reasonable range of the estimated product.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，含零十進換算防漏零。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, including zero to decimal conversion to prevent leakage of zero.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，含零三位數乘以高乘數之進位保留。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, including zero and three-digit carry reservations multiplied by high multipliers.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，含零毫升拆分防呆。": "[Special strategy]: Special 1-II-13, containing zero ml split to prevent fooling around.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，周長逆運算與除法結合。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, combining perimeter inverse operation and division.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，奇偶數快速判斷之「只看個位」策略。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, the \"just look at the ones\" strategy for quick judgment of odd and even numbers.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，定位板輔助：公分在十位、毫米在個位。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, positioning plate assistance: centimeters in the tens place, millimeters in the ones place.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，直角三角形結構分析。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, right triangle structure analysis.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，非零起點測量「終點減起點」迷思排除。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, eliminate the myth of \"end point minus starting point\" for non-zero starting point measurement.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，乘法直式進位紅筆圈記。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, multiplication and straight carry are circled in red pen.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，乘法結果進位至百位的位值擴展。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, place value expansion by carrying the multiplication result to the hundreds place.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，乘數乘個位 0 的防錯提醒（0 乘任何數都是 0）。": "[Specially needed strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, an error-proof reminder for multiplying the multiplier by 0 (any number multiplied by 0 is 0).",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，倒數等差規律找相鄰數。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-II-13, find adjacent numbers according to the law of reciprocal arithmetic.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，借位直式「1公分變10毫米」圖示搭鷹架。": "[Special Strategy]: Special Learning 1-Ⅱ-13, use the straight \"1cm to 10mm\" icon to build a scaffold.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，容量借位「1公升變1000毫升」鷹架引導。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, the capacity is guided by the \"1 liter into 1000 ml\" scaffolding.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，容量滿千進一公升概念圖解。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, conceptual illustration of one liter when the capacity reaches one thousand.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，討論弦與直徑的差異，確認線段是否通過圓心。": "[Learning strategy] 特學1-Ⅱ-13: Discuss a chord and a diameter. Check whether the segment passes through the center.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，迷思破除：邊長不影響角的大小（以扇子開合具體示範）。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, myth dispelling: side length does not affect the size of the angle (example by opening and closing a fan).",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，退位計算後被借位數檢查。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, check the borrowed number after regrouping calculation.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，逆向思維：兩腳開度到直徑。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, reverse thinking: open the feet to the diameter.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，除法核心黃金法則：餘數＜除數。": "[Special Strategy]: Special Learning 1-II-13, the core golden rule of division: remainder < divisor.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，除數決定可能餘數集合之邏輯分析。": "[Special strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, logical analysis of the set of possible remainders determined by the divisor.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，高位進位累加口訣「先乘再加」。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, high carry accumulation formula \"multiply first and then add\".",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，高段九九乘法除法逆運算。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-II-13, advanced multiplication, division, and inverse operations.",
