  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，被借位數字扣減檢核。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, the borrowed digits are deducted and checked.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，連零位值補位訓練。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-II-13, even zero value supplement training.",
