  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，描圖紙疊合比角操作三步驟標準化。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-II-13, standardize the three-step operation of overlaying and comparing angles of tracing paper.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，等差刻度推估未知數。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, arithmetic scale estimation of unknown numbers.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，統一基準（都換成半徑或直徑）再比較。": "[Special strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, unify the benchmark (change them into radius or diameter) and then compare.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，統一單位再比大小之標準策略。": "[Special Strategy]: Special Learning 1-II-13, the standard strategy of unifying units and then comparing their sizes.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，進位至十位且個位記 0 的定位檢查。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, carry to the tens place and record the positioning check of the ones place as 0.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，進位標記與加總計算。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-II-13, carry mark and total calculation.",
