  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，量杯刻度比例尺解析。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, analysis of measuring cup scale scale.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，圓內最長弦幾何性質認知。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-II-13, recognition of the geometric properties of the longest chord in a circle.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，微小減數心算倒數法。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, mental arithmetic reciprocal method for small subtractions.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，跨整千快速估算。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, quick estimation across thousands.",
