  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，滿十進一公分之進位概念分解。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, decomposition of the concept of carrying ten centimeters to one centimeter.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，滿十進位換算（10個百換1個千）。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, full decimal conversion (10 hundreds for 1 thousand).",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，審題除錯：直徑 vs 半徑圓規設定。": "[Special strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, review and troubleshooting: diameter vs radius compass setting.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，審題關鍵詞「比較小」高亮提醒。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, the review keyword \"relatively small\" is highlighted as a reminder.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，複名數非零起點相扣消去法。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, the non-zero starting point elimination method for complex numbers.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，複名數與單名數等價判斷。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special study 1-Ⅱ-13, judging the equivalence of compound numbers and singular numbers.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，整十數乘法末位補零的直觀規律。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, the intuitive rule of adding zeros to the last digit of multiplication of integers.",
