  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，整公數借位減法：5 L ＝ 4 L 1000 mL。": "[Special strategy]: Special learning 1-II-13, borrowing and subtracting integers: 5 L = 4 L 1000 mL.",
  "【特需策略】：特學1-Ⅱ-13，整百數估算。": "[Special needs strategy]: Special learning 1-Ⅱ-13, estimate in hundreds.",
