  "以 2～3 題為起點；需要時減題，最後保留一題相近但不同的題目觀察獨立表現。": "Start with 2–3 questions and reduce the number if needed. Reserve one similar but different question to observe independent work.",
  "以 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 製作互動教具；動物為程式繪製的原創 SVG，動作由 CSS 呈現。": "Interactive teaching aids are produced using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript; animals are programmed to draw original SVGs, and their movements are rendered by CSS.",
  "以「三角板的直角」作為不可動搖的標準物，建立分類流程：吻合=直角、較小=銳角、較大=鈍角。": "Using \"the right angle of a triangle\" as an unshakable standard, a classification process is established: consistent = right angle, smaller = acute angle, larger = obtuse angle.",
  "以三年級數學學習需求為中心，提供可選擇的視覺、語音與操作支持。以下依雲林縣 115 學年度修正版計畫的數位化媒材組整理；功能展示與學生實際成效分開呈現。": "Focusing on the mathematics learning needs of third graders, it provides optional visual, phonological and operational support. The following is a collection of digital media materials for Evian County’s revised plan for the 115th school year; the functional display and actual student results are presented separately.",
  "以上比例均為虛構範例，不代表學生進步，也不能證明提示消褪策略的效果。": "The above proportions are fictitious examples and do not represent student progress, nor can they prove the effectiveness of the prompt fading strategy.",
  "以上調整為建議計畫，是否實際提供及成效均須教師核對。": "The above adjustments are suggested plans, and teachers must verify whether they are actually provided and whether they are effective.",
  "以下列出網站部分頁面使用的字型與程式套件。各項權利仍依原作者的授權條款，不因本網站的教學用途而改變。": "The following fonts and software are used on parts of the website. Their creators’ license terms continue to apply and are not changed by this site’s educational purpose.",
  "以下數字均為虛構示範，不會與上方實際作答紀錄混合，也不能用來診斷學生的認知原因或證明教學成效。": "The following numbers are fictitious demonstrations and will not be mixed with the actual answer records above. They cannot be used to diagnose students' cognitive causes or prove the effectiveness of teaching.",
  "以公平分配理解商與餘數，確認餘數小於除數。": "Use fair sharing to understand the quotient and remainder, and check that the remainder is smaller than the divisor.",
  "以分數 3/5 為例，在空圈想一想書寫順序。": "Taking the fraction 3/5 as an example, think about the writing order in the empty circle.",
  "以可上網的電腦或平板開啟網站，選取單元；不必註冊。": "Open the website with an Internet-enabled computer or tablet and select a unit; no registration is required.",
  "以量杯調出指定容量，連結 1 公升等於 1000 毫升。": "Use a measuring cup to measure the specified volume, connecting 1 liter to 1000 ml.",
  "以黑白呈現位值與算式；教具與操作引導仍可使用，是否獨立完成須另行觀察。": "Show place values and calculations in black and white. Manipulatives and guidance remain available. Observe independent performance separately.",
