  "在畫布正中間點一個紅點，這是圓規針腳插下去的點，旋轉時絕對不可以動，叫做「圓心」！": "Click a red dot in the middle of the canvas. This is the point where the compass pin is inserted. It must not move when rotating. It is called the \"center of the circle\"!",
