  "位值・加減・乘法・測量・幾何・除法・容量・分數・圓": "Place value, addition, subtraction, multiplication, measurement, geometry, division, capacity, fraction, circle",
  "位值易混淆、寫出多位數時可能漏零或多寫零（如一千零五十應寫1050，可能誤寫成150或100050）。提供「千、百、十、個」彩色位值表輔助。": "Place value is easy to confuse, and when writing multiple digits, zeros may be missing or more zeros may be written (for example, one thousand and fifty should be written as 1050, but may be written as 150 or 100050 by mistake). Provides \"Thousands, Hundreds, Tens, and Ones\" color place value table assistance.",
