  "判斷：除法算式中，「除數」可以是 0 嗎？（例如 5 ÷ 0）": "Judgment: In the division equation, can the \"divisor\" be 0? (e.g. 5 ÷ 0)",
  "利用乘法直式計算：": "Use the multiplicative direct expression to calculate:",
  "利用乘法直式計算：⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ = ？": "Use the multiplicative direct expression to calculate: ⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ = ?",
  "利用規則明確的十進位積木替換（滿十進一），以固定的視覺顏色（千紅、百藍、十綠、個橘）建立安定的位值概念。": "Use clear-cut rules for replacing decimal building blocks (full ten to one), and use fixed visual colors (thousands of reds, hundreds of blues, ten greens, and one orange) to establish a stable concept of place value.",
