  "把剛才擺的，讀出來": "Read out what you just laid out",
  "把紙條左端對齊 0，先數 2 個整公分，再數 8 個毫米小格，記錄 28 毫米。": "Align the paper strip's left end with zero. Count 2 whole centimeters and 8 extra millimeter intervals, and record 28 mm.",
