  "步驟一，先數最右邊的個位，看看有幾個一元。": "Step 1: First count the ones digit on the far right to see how many 1 NT$ there are.",
  "步驟一，把二十四拆成二十和四，分成兩塊來算。": "Step 1: Divide twenty-four into twenty and four, and count them in two pieces.",
  "步驟一，牢記換算密碼：一公升等於一千毫升！": "Step 1: Remember the conversion password: one liter equals one thousand milliliters!",
  "步驟一，角有一個紅色的頂點，和兩條直直的邊。": "Step 1: The corner has a red vertex and two straight sides.",
  "步驟一，量東西第一步：把零刻度對齊物品最左邊！": "Step 1, measure things Step 1: Align the zero scale to the far left of the object!",
  "步驟二，先看超過了幾公分粗黑線。": "Step 2: First look at the thick black line that exceeds a few centimeters.",
  "步驟二，先算個位：四乘以三等於十二。": "Step two, first calculate the units digit: four times three equals twelve.",
  "步驟二，看到幾公升，就先換成幾千毫升。": "Step 2: When you see a few liters, change it to thousands of milliliters.",
  "步驟二，拿了三份，三是分子，寫在橫線的上面！": "Step two, take three copies, three is the numerator, write it on the horizontal line!",
  "步驟二，拿出三角板的直角當作裁判標準物。": "Step 2: Take out the right angle of the triangle as the referee standard.",
  "步驟二，從個位開始算，滿十進一，個位寫三，十位頭頂進一。": "Step 2: Start counting from the ones digit, then add one to the tens place, write three to the ones place, and add one to the tens place.",
  "步驟二，從圓心連到邊緣的線叫做半徑。": "Step 2. The line from the center to the edge of the circle is called the radius.",
  "步驟二，數數看有幾個十元硬幣，十位代表幾十元。": "Step 2: Count how many ten-NT$ coins there are. The ten digits represent tens of dollars.",
  "步驟三，用超大放大鏡數小格子，每小格是一毫米。": "Step 3: Use a large magnifying glass to count the small grids. Each small grid is one millimeter.",
  "步驟三，由下往上念作：四分之三！": "Step three, read from bottom to top: three quarters!",
  "步驟三，再算十位：二十乘以三等於六十。": "Step three, then count to tens: twenty times three equals sixty.",
  "步驟三，把零頭毫升加進去，得出全部毫升數。": "Step 3: Add the fraction of milliliters to get the total number of milliliters.",
  "步驟三，兩端在圓周上，而且穿過圓心的線段叫做直徑。": "Step 3: A line segment with both endpoints on the circle that passes through the center is a diameter.",
  "步驟三，算十位時，一定要記得把小藍圈的進位一加進去！": "Step 3: When counting to tens, be sure to add the carry 1 in the small blue circle!",
  "步驟三，蓋上去比比看：較小是銳角、一樣大是直角、較大是鈍角。": "Step 3: Cover them and compare them: the smaller one is an acute angle, the same size is a right angle, and the larger one is an obtuse angle.",
  "步驟三，數數看有幾張一百元鈔票，寫在百位。": "Step 3: Count how many hundred-dollar bills there are and write them in the hundreds place.",
  "步驟五，太棒了，完成四位數直式計算！": "Step five, great, four-digit direct calculation completed!",
  "步驟五，合起來讀作：三千二百五十四元！太棒了！": "Step five, together it reads: three thousand two hundred and fifty four NT$! marvelous!",
  "步驟四，七公分五毫米，就是七十五毫米！恭喜完成！": "Step four, seven centimeters and five millimeters is seventy-five millimeters! Congratulations on completion!",
  "步驟四，把六十和十二加起來，答案是七十二！": "Step four, add sixty and twelve, the answer is seventy-two!",
  "步驟四，直徑等於半徑乘以二！直徑是半徑的兩倍！": "Step 4, the diameter is equal to the radius times two! The diameter is twice the radius!",
  "步驟四，最後數最高位的千位，看看有幾張一千元大鈔。": "Step 4: Finally, count to the highest thousand digit to see how many thousand-dollar bills there are.",
  "步驟四，算出百位與千位，依序寫下來。": "Step 4: Calculate the hundreds and thousands and write them down in order.",
