  "每個籃子還不一樣多。試著輪流分，讓大家公平。": "Each basket has different amounts. Try to take it in turns to make it fair for everyone.",
  "每島三個任務，從具體操作走向數學解題，還有自己的探險護照。": "Each island has three tasks, ranging from concrete operations to mathematical problem solving, and has its own adventure passport.",
  "每島三個任務先操作、再說明。獨立試試會收起提示；使用提示或修正後完成會記為「支持後完成」。每位訪客各有護照，姓名、位置與進度僅記在這台瀏覽器，換題不額外增加島章；完成不代表已精熟。": "There are three tasks on each island, which you can do first and then explain. If you try it independently, the prompts will be suppressed; if you complete it after using the hints or fixes, it will be recorded as \"Complete after support\". Each visitor has his or her own passport, and the name, location, and progress are only recorded in this browser. No additional island stamps will be added when changing questions; completion does not mean mastery.",
