  "每隊先想一想，再由輪到的隊員選答案。答對拉近旗子，連續獨立答對三題會加力。": "Think as a team, then let the teammate whose turn it is choose an answer. Correct answers pull the flag closer. Three independent correct answers in a row give a stronger pull.",
