  "每盤 ⟦0⟧ 個麵包，要準備 ⟦1⟧ 盤。先排好烤盤，再算一共幾個。": "For each plate of ⟦0⟧ bread, prepare ⟦1⟧ plate. Arrange the baking sheets first, and then count how many in total.",
  "每盤 12 個，共 3 盤；30＋6＝36 個。": "Each plate has 12, and there are 3 plates: 30 + 6 = 36 items.",
