  "背背看乘法口訣：⟦0⟧ 的 ⟦1⟧ 倍是多少？": "Memorize the multiplication table: What is ⟦1⟧ times ⟦0⟧?",
  "背誦九九乘法表口訣：": "Recite the multiplication table formula:",
  "背誦九九乘法表口訣：⟦0⟧ 乘以 ⟦1⟧ 得多少？": "Recite the multiplication table formula: How much does ⟦0⟧ multiply by ⟦1⟧?",
  "若九九乘法記不住，不強迫死背！先開啟本平台內建之「九九乘法快查輪」作為認知拐杖，避免卡死在乘法表提取上。": "If you can’t remember the multiplication method, don’t force yourself to memorize it! First, turn on the \"99 Multiplication Quick Wheel\" built into this platform as a cognitive crutch to avoid getting stuck on retrieving multiplication tables.",
  "若手部精細動作差無法用傳統圓規，先使用平台上的數位旋轉圓規建立圓心與半徑心像。": "If you have poor hand movement and are unable to use a traditional compass, first use the digital rotating compass on the platform to establish a mental image of the center and radius of the circle.",
  "若四位數連續退位卡住，先回溯至兩位數減法（如 50 - 24），用實體十元硬幣換成 10 個一元，體驗借位實體感。": "If the four-digit numbers are stuck in consecutive subtractions, go back to the two-digit subtraction (such as 50 - 24), exchange the physical ten-NT$ coins for 10 one-NT$ coins, and experience the physical feeling of borrowing.",
  "若毫升數字太大造成排斥，先連結喝一口水、養樂多一瓶的具體生活容量感受。": "If the milliliter number is too large and causes rejection, first combine the actual living capacity experience of drinking a sip of water and a bottle of Yakult.",
  "若無法理解分數，先從「切蛋糕一人一半」開始，強調每一塊必須「一樣大（等分）」。": "If you can't understand fractions, start with \"cutting the cake in half for each person\" and emphasize that each piece must be \"the same size (equally divided)\".",
  "若無法理解除法符號 ÷，先回到「連減」與分物盤，一顆一顆平分分裝體驗。": "If you can't understand the division symbol ÷, first go back to \"Continuous Subtraction\" and the dividing plate, and divide the pieces one by one into equal pieces to experience.",
  "若無法辨認直角，先帶學生用手掌摸教室課本的四個角、黑板的四個角，感受方正的直角。": "If you cannot identify a right angle, first have the students touch the four corners of the classroom textbook and the four corners of the blackboard with their palms to feel the square right angle.",
  "若學生不理解千位，先回溯使用 100 元鈔票進行十進位換算（10張百元鈔=1張千元鈔），穩固百位後再引入千位。": "If thousands are not yet understood, exchange ten NT$100 notes for one NT$1,000 note. Consolidate hundreds before introducing thousands.",
  "若學生連整公分都不會看，先使用粗線公分尺測量大物體，確立「從 0 開始量」的定錨經驗。": "If students can't even read centimeters, first use a thick-line centimeter ruler to measure large objects to establish the anchoring experience of \"starting measurement from 0.\"",
  "要比較兩個角的大小，用疊合方法比比看時，首先應該對齊哪裡？": "To compare the size of two angles, where should they be aligned first when comparing using the superposition method?",
  "要快速判斷一個多位數是「奇數」還是「偶數」，只要看它的哪一個位數？": "To quickly determine whether a multi-digit number is \"odd\" or \"even\", just look at which digit?",
  "要快速判斷一個多位數是奇數還是偶數，只要看它的哪一個位數？": "To quickly determine whether a multi-digit number is \"odd\" or \"even\", just look at which digit?",
