  "迷思概念：常誤以為「邊畫得比較長，角就比較大」。藉由動態扣條旋轉，讓學童看見「張開程度」才是角的大小。": "Myth concept: It is often mistakenly believed that \"the longer the side is, the larger the corner will be\". Through the dynamic buckle rotation, students can see that the \"opening degree\" is the size of the horn.",
