  "除法：整除與有餘數的除法。一位數除以一位數、二位數除以一位數。除法直式。驗算關係式。": "Division: Integer division and division with remainder. Divide a one-digit number by a one-digit number, and divide a two-digit number by a one-digit number. Division in straight form. Check the relationship.",
