  "除法直式步驟繁多（商、乘、減、降），容易漏步驟或不知道商要寫在哪個位數。提供四步口訣與位值防呆框。": "There are many steps in the direct form of division (quotient, multiplication, subtraction, and subtraction), and it is easy to miss steps or not know which digit the quotient should be written in. Provides four-step formula and place value fool-proof frame.",
