  "請依序輸出： 1. 可觀察的目標（條件、表現及達成標準）。 2. 先備檢核與 40 分鐘流程，寫清楚教師引導及學生行動。 3. 全提示、部分提示與獨立嘗試三種支持方式；支持依觀察調整，不能只用障礙標籤決定。 4. 操作員、說明員、檢查員輪替的合作任務。 5. 五題練習，附答案、逐步解釋與教師複核欄。 6. 首次作答、提示程度、操作及口述的觀察表。 學生需求由教師另行以不含身分資訊的方式補充。不得編造學生表現、試教成效、研究引文或障礙診斷。請將不確定處標示為需教師確認，計算與課綱代碼均須由教師複核。": "Please output in order: 1. Observable goals (conditions, performance and achievement standards). 2. Prepare and review the 40-minute process first, and write down clearly the teacher’s guidance and student actions. 3. There are three support methods: full prompts, partial prompts and independent attempts; support is adjusted based on observation and cannot be determined by obstacle labels alone. 4. The cooperative tasks of operators, instructions and inspectors taking turns. 5. Five-question exercises with answers, step-by-step explanations and teacher review columns. 6. Observation form for first time answering, prompting level, operation and oral presentation. Students' needs are supplemented by teachers separately in a way that does not contain identifying information. Do not fabricate student performance, trial results, research citations, or disorder diagnoses. Please mark any uncertainties as requiring teacher confirmation. Both calculations and syllabus codes must be reviewed by the teacher.",
  "請依實際課堂表現補充，不以星星數推定概念精熟。": "Please make supplements based on your actual class performance. Do not rely on the number of stars to infer conceptual proficiency.",
  "請兩隊各說一個方法並輪替角色。若競速造成負擔，可回到隨堂練習採輪流合作。": "Ask each team to explain one method and rotate roles. If speed is a burden, return to Class Practice for cooperative turn-taking.",
  "請孩子向您分享今天在數學課學到的一個口訣！": "Ask your children to share with you a formula they learned in math class today!",
  "請孩子在冰箱找找鮮奶瓶上的容量標示，看看是不是剛好寫著「1000 mL (1公升)」！": "Ask your child to look for the capacity label on the fresh milk bottle in the refrigerator to see if it just says \"1000 mL (1 liter)\"!",
  "請孩子找出家裡有「正方形」或「長方形」四個直角的物品（如書本、磁磚）！": "Invite the children to find items (such as books, tiles) with four right angles in the house that are \"square\" or \"rectangular\"!",
  "請孩子找找家中圓形的物品（時鐘、杯蓋、車輪），並指出正中間的圓心位置！": "Ask the children to find round objects in the house (clocks, cup lids, wheels) and point out the center of the circle in the middle!",
  "請孩子拿直尺量量家裡的牙刷或鉛筆，找出上面細細的「毫米(mm)」刻度！": "Invite your children to use a ruler to measure the toothbrush or pencil at home and find the fine \"millimeter (mm)\" scale on it!",
  "請孩子幫忙把餐桌上的筷子分發，算算看 3 個人每人拿 2 雙，一共有幾雙！": "Ask the children to help distribute the chopsticks on the table. Count how many pairs there are in total if 3 people each get 2 pairs!",
  "請指出你用到的圖像、材料或關係，說明為什麼這樣做。": "Point to the picture, materials, or relationship you used, and explain why your method works.",
  "請家長帶孩子看看錢包裡的鈔票，數數看有幾張 1000 元、幾張 100 元，大聲念出總共是多少元！": "Parents are asked to take their children to look at the bills in their wallets, count how many are 1,000 NT$, how many are 100 NT$, and read out loud the total number of NT$!",
  "請記得填寫①算式喔！": "Please remember to fill in the calculation formula ①!",
  "請記得填寫②答的數值喔！": "Please remember to fill in the value of ② answer!",
