  "餘數": "Remainder",
  "餘數 9 比除數 6 還大，商還可以再多 1": "The remainder 9 is greater than the divisor 6, and the quotient can be 1 more",
  "餘數 9 居然比除數 6 還大，代表還可以再分出 1 份，商應該是 7，餘數是 3！": "The remainder 9 is actually larger than the divisor 6, which means that one more part can be divided. The quotient should be 7 and the remainder is 3!",
  "餘數一定要比除數 5 小，所以只能是 1、2、3、4（或整除 0）！": "The remainder must be smaller than the divisor 5, so it can only be 1, 2, 3, 4 (or evenly divided by 0)!",
  "餘數一定要比除數「小」": "The remainder must be \"smaller\" than the divisor",
  "餘數一定要和除數一樣大": "The remainder must be as large as the divisor",
  "餘數大於除數卻沒察覺的迷思": "The myth that the remainder is greater than the divisor without realizing it",
  "餘數可以比除數大": "The remainder can be greater than the divisor",
  "餘數必須小於除數，除數是": "The remainder must be less than the divisor, which is",
  "餘數必須小於除數，除數是 ⟦0⟧，因此最大餘數是 ⟦1⟧！": "The remainder must be less than the divisor, which is ⟦0⟧, so the maximum remainder is ⟦1⟧!",
  "餘數越大越好": "The larger the remainder, the better",
