  "學習領域：數學領域（南一版三上 · 108普通課綱代碼：⟦1⟧）": "Field of study: Mathematics (South 1st Edition 3Shang · 108 General Curriculum Code: ⟦1⟧)",
  "學習歷程：計算對齊、分段引導": "Process: aligned working, steps",
