  "選「森林拔河運動會」第一單元，依已教小節練習四位數位值、讀寫與比較；需要時先用森林超商回顧換幣。": "Select Unit 1 in Forest Tug of War to practise four-digit place value, reading, writing, and comparison by taught section. Review coin exchanges in Forest Supermarket if needed.",
