  "選「森林拔河運動會」第二單元或「三四位數直式加減」，先共同完成一題，再說出進位或退位的位置。": "Select Unit 2 in Forest Tug of War or Three- and Four-Digit Column Addition and Subtraction. Complete one example together, then explain where regrouping happens.",
  "選「森林拔河運動會」第八單元，練習分數讀圖與比較；先確認同樣大的整體與等分，再說出選項的理由。": "Select Unit 8 in Forest Tug of War to read and compare fractions. Check equal-sized wholes and equal parts before explaining the choice.",
  "選「森林拔河運動會」第三單元，依小節練習乘法；先說明每組數量與組數，再用拆分方法檢查答案。": "Select Unit 3 in Forest Tug of War to practise multiplication by section. Explain the amount in each group and the number of groups, then check by partitioning.",
