  "選「森林拔河運動會」第六單元，依小節練習除法與餘數；用分物或乘法驗算解釋商與剩餘。": "Select Unit 6 in Forest Tug of War to practise division and remainders by section. Use sharing or multiplication to explain the quotient and what remains.",
