  "輪流計算與說明解法；答錯不扣分，確認方法後再前進。": "Take turns calculating and explaining. Incorrect answers do not lose points; discuss the method before moving on.",
  "選擇符合本課概念的遊戲，先示範玩法，再讓學生操作。": "Choose a game that matches the lesson concept. Demonstrate the rules before learners play.",
  "前往目前單元的數學島，完成一個任務並說說怎麼想；最後回顧今天的方法。": "Visit the current unit’s math island, try one mission and explain your thinking. Finish by reviewing the method.",
  "⟦6⟧ · ⟦7⟧ 分鐘": "⟦6⟧ · ⟦7⟧ minutes",
  "可用「森林超商大採購」回顧錢幣與進位；其較小數值活動只作先備練習，最後仍回到四位數位值。": "Use Forest Supermarket Shopping to review money and regrouping. Its smaller-number activities are prerequisite review; return to four-digit place value afterward.",
  "可選「數學拔河大對決」的乘法題型；先確認實際數值範圍符合學生能力，再開始短回合。": "Use multiplication questions in Math Tug of War. Check the actual number range against students' readiness before starting a short round.",
  "可選「數學拔河大對決」的除法題型；若題目只有整除，仍須另用分物任務觀察餘數概念。": "Use division questions in Math Tug of War. If questions have no remainder, use a separate sharing task to check understanding of remainders.",
  "目前遊戲館沒有專門的分數闖關；可回到分數盤做「聽分數、選切片」合作挑戰，再前往披薩島。": "The game gallery has no dedicated fraction challenge. Use the fraction tool for a cooperative “hear the fraction, choose the slices” challenge, then visit Pizza Island.",
  "目前遊戲館沒有專門的角與四邊形闖關；可回到本課圖形做「轉一轉、找證據」配對挑戰，再前往幾何島。": "The game gallery has no dedicated angle and quadrilateral challenge. Use the classroom shapes for a cooperative “rotate and find evidence” matching challenge, then visit the geometry island.",
  "目前遊戲館沒有專門的圓形闖關；可用本課圓規做「聽直徑、設半徑」合作挑戰，再前往摩天輪島。": "The game gallery has no dedicated circle challenge. Use the compass tool for a cooperative “hear the diameter, set the radius” challenge, then visit Ferris Wheel Island.",
  "遊戲館的混合單位題不等同毫米實測；可回到本課直尺，做「估一估、量一量」合作挑戰。": "Mixed-unit questions in the game gallery do not assess millimeter measurement. Use the classroom ruler for a cooperative “estimate and measure” challenge.",
  "遊戲館的單位混合題須先確認是否含容量；也可用本課量杯進行「調出指定容量」合作挑戰。": "Check whether mixed-unit questions in the game gallery include capacity. Alternatively, use the classroom measuring cup for a cooperative “make the target capacity” challenge.",
  "選「三四位數直式加減」，先共同完成一題，再讓學生說出進位或退位的位置。": "Choose Three- and Four-Digit Written Addition and Subtraction. Complete one question together, then ask the student to identify where regrouping occurs.",
  "放大顯示": "Enlarge",
  "跨年級版本目前參考南一 115 上及 114 下教材。下學期參考材料與平台所採 115 學年度安排有版次差異，尤其三下「找規律」尚缺 115 下同版原書，不能標示為同版逐題核對完成。": "The cross-grade edition currently references Nani 115 first-semester and 114 second-semester materials. Second-semester references differ from the platform’s 115 school-year sequence. In particular, the matching 115 second-semester source for Grade 3 patterns is unavailable; it has not been verified exercise by exercise against that edition.",
